  "instructions": [
    "Rinse lentils under cold water until water runs clear.",
    "In a large pot, heat olive oil over medium heat and sauté onion until translucent.",
    "Add garlic and cook for 30 seconds until fragrant.",
    "Stir in cumin and paprika, cooking for another minute.",
    "Add canned tomatoes with juice, lentils, and vegetable broth; bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat, cover, and simmer for 25 minutes or until lentils are tender.",
    "Stir in lemon juice and chopped mint, seasoning with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Simmer uncovered for 5 minutes to meld flavors.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning if needed.",
    "Serve hot, optionally garnished with extra mint leaves."
